@startuml
title <size:20><b>VoxFlow - Speech Session Capture Sequence</b></size>\n<size:12>ESP32 Hardware, Python Serial Bridge & REST Ingestion</size>

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 170

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #475569
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantFontStyle bold

    ActorBorderColor #334155
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorFontStyle bold
}

skinparam participant {
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as User #DBEAFE
participant "ESP32 Dev Module" as ESP #BFDBFE
participant "INMP441 Microphone" as Mic #DBEAFE
participant "Python Serial Bridge" as Bridge #EDE9FE
participant "Flask REST API" as API #E0F2FE

== 1. Initialization & Handshake ==

Bridge -> ESP : PING\n(USB Serial / 460800 baud)
ESP --> Bridge : PONG

Bridge -> API : POST /api/v1/session/start
API --> Bridge : 201 Created (session_id)

== 2. Audio Capture Execution ==

alt Physical-Buttons Mode (--physical-buttons)
    User -> ESP : Press START Button (GPIO27)
else Serial-Start Mode (Default)
    Bridge -> ESP : START command
end

ESP -> ESP : Status LED ON (GPIO4 HIGH)

loop Continuous I2S Sampling (16 kHz 16-bit Mono)
    ESP -> Mic : Read I2S PCM (SCK: 26, WS: 25, SD: 32)
    Mic --> ESP : 16-bit audio samples
    ESP -> ESP : Store in buffer
end

alt User Terminated
    User -> ESP : Press STOP Button (GPIO33)
else Auto Timeout
    ESP -> ESP : 60-second limit reached
end

== 3. Dynamic Framing & Serial Transmission ==

ESP -> ESP : Calculate exact AUDIO_BYTES
ESP -> Bridge : Header: RECORDING\nAUDIO_BYTES=<exact_bytes>\nSAMPLE_RATE=16000\nFORMAT=PCM_S16LE_MONO

ESP -> Bridge : Binary PCM stream (exact AUDIO_BYTES)
ESP -> Bridge : DONE marker
ESP -> ESP : Status LED OFF (GPIO4 LOW)

== 4. Local WAV Assembly & API Ingestion ==

Bridge -> Bridge : Write WAV container (16 kHz, 16-bit mono)
Bridge -> API : POST /api/v1/session/<session_id>/audio (multipart WAV)
API --> Bridge : 200 OK (Audio uploaded)

Bridge -> API : POST /api/v1/session/<session_id>/stop
API --> Bridge : 200 OK (Session stopped)

Bridge -> API : POST /api/v1/session/<session_id>/analyze
API --> Bridge : 200 OK (Analysis complete)

@enduml